<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA- TALLINNA REGISTERS NEW INVESTMENT FUNDS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA- TALLINNA REGISTERS NEW INVESTMENT FUNDS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Panga Varahaldus, the investment subsidiary of Tallinna Pank , said on Tuesday it had registered two new investment funds.</p>
<p>TP Rahaturufond (TP Money market fund) will be launched from August 1 and the TALSE Indeksifond (Talse Index Fund) in the middle of August, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>TP Rahaturufond will invest in short-term financial instruments with high liquidity and low risks, it added.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
